{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Dash: Toast of Destiny is a side-scrolling, fast-paced anime action game with a classic dot-picture style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The meeting of destiny is at the end of the run!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is the most\u00a0thrilling anime action starts with being late!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Haruka Ran, is a regular high school girl who's eager to meet her destiny. <br>Every morning, she's always in a rush with a loaf of bread in her mouth. <br>Today's the day of the long-awaited school trip. <br>She wonders, &quot;Could it be that I meet the man of my dreams on the trip? <br>Just as I was starting to feel hopeful, I remembered: &quot;Oh no, I'm late, I'm late! Late, late, late!\u201d <br>With a slice of bread in her mouth, Ran will start running again today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/c00e5b063bb8c5eb643ab3cfd1a69b85.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/c00e5b063bb8c5eb643ab3cfd1a69b85.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just an action game. The story unfolds through in-game animations depicting Ran\u2019s daily life. What's in store for Ran at the end of her run? Is this her destiny, or... The truth is that you'll find out the truth of your run...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/a439a7950f34edb20bf569591539fe84.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/a439a7950f34edb20bf569591539fe84.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/3d018bac0aad01313173b5a4f54e1845.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/3d018bac0aad01313173b5a4f54e1845.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple\u2014just jump and dash\u2014but timing is everything. The speed and tempo are addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/be4227180595d600892378dc01f23d50.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/be4227180595d600892378dc01f23d50.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/0a12522528e82e96ba0f4b81931905a0.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/0a12522528e82e96ba0f4b81931905a0.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use helpful items to keep your stamina up during the run! Try to avoid things like barricades, clouds, and dogs by jumping and performing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/14546035d0b4b2ffe9f2f17bd690e8a2.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/14546035d0b4b2ffe9f2f17bd690e8a2.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/85831e40ef716d014154e8b3c2b9f5d6.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/85831e40ef716d014154e8b3c2b9f5d6.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a regular school route to a school trip to Kyoto to a date spot with a gorgeous night view! Each area is packed with gimmicks and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/e8a76359cf6ebf902cacf5c62a76002d.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/e8a76359cf6ebf902cacf5c62a76002d.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The screen is still in development and may differ from the final specifications.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I\u2019m Running Late!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Is He the One?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"I Wish I Could See You Again\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"The Secret of Haruka Ran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Extremely Hard Mode unlocked!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Light Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Has a Talent For Running?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Top Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Breaking the Limit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Running Through Hell in Uniform","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3756520/32a11e35f569dedaeb39069cae8ee110b617b3c7.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756520?t=1761880142","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/c63736613d39e227316a5d4a33b132702e16d650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761880142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/eb645ece956c902c4063c4d1ce4319ba7bee1645/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761880142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/eb645ece956c902c4063c4d1ce4319ba7bee1645/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761880142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3902170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Dash: Toast of Destiny is a side-scrolling, fast-paced anime action game with a classic dot-picture style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The meeting of destiny is at the end of the run!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is the most\u00a0thrilling anime action starts with being late!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Haruka Ran, is a regular high school girl who's eager to meet her destiny. <br>Every morning, she's always in a rush with a loaf of bread in her mouth. <br>Today's the day of the long-awaited school trip. <br>She wonders, &quot;Could it be that I meet the man of my dreams on the trip? <br>Just as I was starting to feel hopeful, I remembered: &quot;Oh no, I'm late, I'm late! Late, late, late!\u201d <br>With a slice of bread in her mouth, Ran will start running again today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/c00e5b063bb8c5eb643ab3cfd1a69b85.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/c00e5b063bb8c5eb643ab3cfd1a69b85.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just an action game. The story unfolds through in-game animations depicting Ran\u2019s daily life. What's in store for Ran at the end of her run? Is this her destiny, or... The truth is that you'll find out the truth of your run...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras/a439a7950f34edb20bf569591539fe84.avif?t=1761880142\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756520/extras_big/a439a7950f34edb20bf569591539fe84.avif?t=1761880142 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/